AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_30853> "18beta-Glycyrrhetinic acid is a pentacyclic triterpenoid found in the Glycyrrhiza glabra L.(liquorice) roots. It is the key metabolite of glycyrrhizin and glycyrrhizic acid.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasOBONamespace> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_30853> "human_microbiome_drug_metabolism")
