# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_31483> (<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_31483>)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_31483> "The 17,21-diacetate derivative of diflorasone. It is used topically for its anti-inflammatory and antipruritic properties in the treatment of various skin disorders.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasOBONamespace> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_31483> "human_microbiome_drug_metabolism")
