# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_3534> (<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_3534>)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_3534> "A semisynthetic first-generation cephalosporin antibiotic having methyl and β-(2R)-2-amino-2-phenylacetamido groups at the 3- and 7- of the cephem skeleton, respectively. It is effective against both Gram-negative and Gram-positive organisms, and is used for treatment of infections of the skin, respiratory tract and urinary tract.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasOBONamespace> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_3534> "human_microbiome_drug_metabolism")
