# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_472805> (<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_472805>)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_472805> "A steroid hormone that is a multi-hydroxylated α-L-rhamnosyl cardenoloide. It binds to and inhibits the plasma membrane Na+/K+-ATPase (sodium pump). It has been isolated naturally from Strophanthus gratus.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasOBONamespace> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_472805> "human_microbiome_drug_metabolism")
