# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_47381> (<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_47381>)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_47381> "A monocarboxylic acid consisting of phenylacetic acid having a (2,6-dichlorophenyl)amino group at the 2-position.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasOBONamespace> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_47381> "human_microbiome_drug_metabolism")
