AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_5134> "A trifluorinated corticosteroid used in the form of its propionate ester for treatment of allergic rhinitis.")
