AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_64356> "A γ-amino acid that is γ-aminobutyric acid (GABA) carrying an isobutyl substitutent at the β-position (the S-enantiomer). Binds with high affinity to the α2-δ site (an auxiliary subunit of voltage-gated calcium channels) in central nervous system tissues.")
