# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_6904> (<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_6904>)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_6904> "A propanolamine that is 1-(propan-2-ylamino)propan-2-ol substituted by a 4-(2-methoxyethyl)phenoxy group at position 1.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasOBONamespace> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_6904> "human_microbiome_drug_metabolism")
