AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_7628> "A 3-oxo Δ4-steroid that is norethisterone in which the hydroxy group has been converted to its acetate ester.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasOBONamespace> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_7628> "human_microbiome_drug_metabolism")
