# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_7772> (<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_7772>)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_7772> "A racemate comprising equimolar amounts of (R)- and (S)-omeprazole.")
