# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HMDM_0000098> (<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HMDM_0000098>)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HMDM_0000098> "The process of breaking down of a cardiac therapy drug which improve the heart's energy production and efficiency.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasOBONamespace> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HMDM_0000098> "human_microbiome_drug_metabolism")
