AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:31158845") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:34416161") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HMDM_0000234> "The Bacteroides dorei 3-oxo-5-alpha-steroid 4-dehydrogenase (BACDOR_03091) product metabolize Levonorgestrel, drospirenone, and Norethindrone acetate. This enzyme (5-alpha-reductase) is also associated with three gene cluster (5-alpha-reductase, 5-beta-reductase, 3-beta-HSDH) in conversion of secondary bile acids acid 3-oxoLCA to isoalloLCA.")
