AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:31209107") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:34260950") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HMDM_0000467> "Bacterial 20beta-hydroxysteroid dehydrogenase (20beta-HSDH) is a NADH-dependent oxidoreductase belonging to the SDR family and is expressed by some strains of B. adolescentis and it regulates cortisol side-chain cleavage by reducing the C-20 carboxyl group on cortisol, yielding 20beta-dihydrocortisol.")
