AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HMDM_0000824> "The anti-diabetic agent are used to prevent blood glucose from rising in the treatment of diabetes mellitus.")
