AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:39032655") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HMDM_0000933> "CYP107S1 is a cytochrome P450 (CYP) enzyme found in the bacterium Pseudomonas aeruginosa. It can metabolize fluoroquinolone antibiotics (ciprofloxacin and fleroxacin), a cystic fibrosis transmembrane conductance regulator potentiator (ivacaftor), and a selective estrogen receptor modulator antimicrobial adjuvant (raloxifene).")
